          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El archivo de registro se conserva: %1$@ en %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The monitor was not showing a picture, so nothing was saved." : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip on the No Picture to Save badge",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Monitor zeigte kein Bild, daher wurde nichts gesichert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El monitor no mostraba ninguna imagen, así que no se guardó nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number that marks a new launch in the log." : {
      "comment" : "Data settings: what the log session counter is",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Nummer, die im Protokoll einen neuen Start markiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El número que marca un nuevo inicio en el registro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture could not be made into an image file. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Snapshot Not Saved badge tooltip: the picture could not be rendered or encoded",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus dem Bild konnte keine Bilddatei erstellt werden. Versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo convertir la imagen en un archivo de imagen. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program size must be at least 16 by 16 pixels." : {
      "comment" : "Custom program size sheet: a width or height is too small",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Programmgröße muss mindestens 16 × 16 Pixel betragen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tamaño del programa debe ser de al menos 16 por 16 píxeles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program size must be even — 4:2:0 delivery requires it." : {
      "comment" : "Custom program size sheet: a width or height is odd",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Programmgröße muss gerade sein – die 4:2:0-Auslieferung erfordert es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tamaño del programa debe ser par: la entrega 4:2:0 lo exige."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The program streams to every enabled destination at once. Start Streaming (⌘G) is in the main window's toolbar; stream keys are kept in the Keychain, never in the project file." : {
      "comment" : "Streaming settings: footer under the status row",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Programm streamt gleichzeitig zu jedem aktivierten Ziel. „Streaming starten“ (⌘G) befindet sich in der Symbolleiste des Hauptfensters; Streamschlüssel werden im Schlüsselbund gespeichert, nie in der Projektdatei."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El programa se transmite a todos los destinos activados a la vez. Iniciar transmisión (⌘G) está en la barra de herramientas de la ventana principal; las claves de transmisión se guardan en el llavero, nunca en el archivo del proyecto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording stopped and could not continue." : {
      "comment" : "Recording error shown when the file sink failed and the recording ended",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Aufnahme wurde gestoppt und konnte nicht fortgesetzt werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La grabación se detuvo y no pudo continuar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recordings folder could not be created: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Recording error when the chosen folder cannot be created",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Aufnahmeordner konnte nicht erstellt werden: %@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo crear la carpeta de grabaciones: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The show: presets, shots, layers, and audio channels." : {
      "comment" : "Data settings: what the project document holds",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Sendung: Voreinstellungen, Einstellungen, Ebenen und Audiokanäle."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El programa: preajustes, tomas, capas y canales de audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The size and frame rate the program is composited and delivered at. Changes apply at once; they are unavailable while streaming or recording." : {
      "comment" : "Caption of the custom program size sheet",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Größe und Bildrate, mit denen das Programm zusammengesetzt und ausgeliefert wird. Änderungen gelten sofort; während des Streamens oder Aufnehmens sind sie nicht verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tamaño y la frecuencia de fotogramas con que se compone y entrega el programa. Los cambios se aplican de inmediato; no están disponibles mientras se transmite o se graba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snapshot could not be saved in %@: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Snapshot Not Saved badge tooltip: the file could not be written; the placeholders are the folder and the system's reason",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Standbild konnte nicht in %1$@ gesichert werden: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo guardar la instantánea en %1$@: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This empties the %@ Tingra has recorded so far. New activity is still logged, so the next log you share covers only the problem you are reporting. This cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation alert message before emptying the log file; the placeholder is its size",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dadurch werden die bisher aufgezeichneten %@ gelöscht. Neue Aktivitäten werden weiter protokolliert, sodass das nächste geteilte Protokoll nur das gemeldete Problem umfasst. Dies kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto vacía los %@ que Tingra ha registrado hasta ahora. La nueva actividad sigue registrándose, así que el próximo registro que comparta cubrirá solo el problema que está informando. Esto no se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes what Tingra has saved on this Mac, then quits. It cannot be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation alert message before removing all data: the opening line",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies entfernt, was Tingra auf diesem Mac gesichert hat, und beendet dann Tingra. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto elimina lo que Tingra ha guardado en este Mac y luego sale. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tingra has stopped saving so nothing is written back. Quit Tingra, then remove what remains by hand." : {
      "comment" : "Data settings: footer under the kinds of data that could not be removed",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra sichert nicht mehr, damit nichts zurückgeschrieben wird. Beende Tingra und entferne den Rest von Hand."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tingra ha dejado de guardar para que nada se vuelva a escribir. Sal de Tingra y elimina lo que queda a mano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tingra Log" : {
      "comment" : "Logging settings: the shared log file's title in the share picker",
